        <h1 class="display-5 fw-bold"><span style="color: black;">Sanghvi Horizon</span><span style="color: #6d4d1b;"></span></h1>
   <p class="lead mt-3 mb-4" style="font-size: 1.05rem; color: #000000; font-weight: 500;">Sanghvi Horizon represents the next step in modern urban living, right in the pulse of Mumbai. This thoughtfully designed residential enclave offers 1, 2, and 3 BHK homes that balance comfort with style. Developed by the renowned Sanghvi Realty, this upcoming project is set to redefine city living with an expected possession date of June 2030.</p>
          <button class="btn btn-lg px-4 py-3" data-bs-toggle="modal" data-bs-target="#exampleModal" style="background-color: rgb(77, 0, 0); color:#ffffff; border:none; border-radius: 50px; box-shadow: 0 8px 20px rgba(90, 8, 8, 0.3); font-size: 1.1rem;"><b>Register for Project Updates</b></button>
