    <section class="about_us ptb-80 bg-grey" id="About">
        <div class="container">
            <div class="row">
                <div class="col-md-12">
                    <h2>Overview of Sanghvi Horizon</h2>
                    <span class="divied"></span>
            <p>Sanghvi Horizon is an <strong>upcoming residential apartment project</strong> by <strong>Sanghvi Realty</strong> in <strong>Mumbai, Maharashtra</strong>, offering thoughtfully planned <strong>1, 2 &amp; 3 BHK apartments</strong>. Designed to meet the needs of modern homebuyers, the project aims to provide comfortable living spaces in a well-connected location with access to essential social and civic infrastructure. The <strong>unit sizes are yet to be announced</strong>, while the <strong>prices are available on request</strong>, making it an excellent opportunity for early buyers and investors.</p>
<p>With <strong>RERA registration to be announced</strong>, <strong><a href="https://sanghvimumbaiprojects.com/sanghvi-horizon/" style="color: #476bc5;">Sanghvi Horizon</a></strong>&nbsp;is expected to offer quality construction, contemporary architecture, and a range of lifestyle amenities. The project is currently in the <strong>upcoming stage</strong>, with <strong>possession expected by June 2030</strong>, making it an ideal choice for those planning a future-ready home in one of Mumbai's rapidly developing residential destinations.</p>
      <div class="sattva-highlights" style= "background-color: #722F37; padding: 1px; margin: 15px 0;">
  <div style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; background-color: #fff; padding: 20px; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.08);">

    <!-- Left Section -->
    <div style="flex: 1; min-width: 300px; padding: 20px;">
      <h3 style="margin-top: 0; color: #0a3a75; font-size: 1.5rem;"><b>Project Highlights</b></h3>
      <ul style="padding-left: 25px; margin: 0;">
         <li><strong>Project Name:</strong> Sanghvi Horizon</li>
    <li><strong>Developer:</strong> Sanghvi Realty</li>
    <li><strong>Location:</strong> Borivali East, Mumbai, Maharashtra</li>
    <li><strong>Project Type:</strong> Residential Apartments</li>
    <li><strong>Project Status:</strong> Under Construction</li>
    <li><strong>Configuration:</strong> 1 &amp; 2 BHK Apartments</li>
    <li><strong>Sizes:</strong> 437 – 717 sq. ft. (Carpet Area)</li>
    <li><strong>Price:</strong> ₹1.09 Crore* Onwards</li>
    <li><strong>RERA Status:</strong> P51800054086</li>
    <li><strong>Possession:</strong> Expected by December 2028</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <!-- Right Section -->
<div style="flex: 1; min-width: 300px; padding: 20px;">
  <h3 style="margin-top: 0; color: #0a3a75; font-size: 1.5rem;"><b>Key Features</b></h3>
  <ul style="padding-left: 25px; margin: 0;">
    <li>Located in a prime area of Mumbai with excellent connectivity options</li>
    <li>Homes available in 1, 2, and 3 BHK configurations to suit various needs</li>
    <li>Designed with contemporary amenities including a clubhouse and swimming pool</li>
    <li>Close to reputed schools, hospitals, and shopping centers</li>
    <li>Easy access to business hubs and entertainment districts</li>
    <li>Developed by the trusted Sanghvi Realty, known for their quality construction</li>
  </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
