                        <h2>Location & Connectivity: Borivali East, Mumbai</h2>
                         <span class="divied"></span>
                           </div>
                         <div style="position: relative; padding-bottom: 36.25%; height: 0; overflow: hidden; max-width: 100%; height: auto;">
                                <iframe src="https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d241318.22867176824!2d72.71354061439699!3d19.081434215789436!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x3be7c6306644edc1%3A0x5da4ed8f8d648c69!2sMumbai%2C%20Maharashtra!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sin!4v1784958573855!5m2!1sen!2sin"  width="500" height="450" style="border:0; position: absolute; top: 0; left: 0; width: 95%; height: 90%;" allowfullscreen="" loading="lazy" referrerpolicy="no-referrer-when-downgrade" title="Sanghvi Horizon location on Google map"></iframe>
                              </div>
                            </div>
                         </div>
                     <div class="row">
                        <div class="col-md-12">
                            <div class="WhychoseBIx">
                       <p>Sanghvi Horizon enjoys a prime position in Borivali East, Mumbai, offering seamless connectivity to the city's key commercial and entertainment hubs. This established locale offers the ideal mix of urban convenience and a serene residential atmosphere, making it a highly desirable address.</p>
<h3><strong>Strategic Connectivity</strong></h3>
<ul>
  <li><strong>Western Express Highway:</strong> Offers smooth access to the highway, linking to major business districts.</li>
  <li><strong>Local Railway Network:</strong> Close proximity to the Western and Central Railway lines ensures hassle-free commutes.</li>
  <li><strong>Major Arterial Roads:</strong> Key roads connect directly to all parts of the city, making travel easy and efficient.</li>
  <li><strong>Upcoming Metro:</strong> The upcoming metro line will further enhance connectivity to the area.</li>
</ul>
<h3><strong>Nearby Landmarks & Everyday Convenience</strong></h3>
<ul>
  <li><strong>Educational Institutions:</strong> Renowned schools and colleges are located within a short distance.</li>
  <li><strong>Healthcare Facilities:</strong> Multi-specialty hospitals and clinics provide top-notch medical care.</li>
  <li><strong>Shopping & Entertainment:</strong> Premium malls, multiplexes, and markets are easily accessible.</li>
  <li><strong>Green Spaces:</strong> Nearby parks and recreational areas offer a refreshing environment.</li>
</ul>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>                
    </section>
